{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"mx-microscaling-shared-scale","content_sha256":"sha256:67219e4b44a33bdef2a11ae79ec3f18912bf17d8585b766c35fca16e88a5f9c6","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789968445.997961,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"MX 格式 = 低比特元素 + 每 32 元素一个 E8M0 幂次共享 scale；块级微缩放在 4/8-bit 上兼顾动态范围与精度，是 Blackwell FP4/FP6 通路的数值基础。","id":"q-op-hwq2-mx-scale-e8m0","options":[{"id":"a","text":"把每 32 个元素分为一块，块内共享一个 8 位(E8M0，2 的幂)缩放因子，元素本身用低比特(FP4/FP8)存，靠细粒度 per-block scale 保持精度"},{"id":"b","text":"整个张量共享一个 FP32 缩放因子"},{"id":"c","text":"不使用任何缩放因子，直接截断"},{"id":"d","text":"每个元素各带一个 FP32 缩放因子"}],"prompt":"OCP Microscaling(MX)格式(如 MXFP4/MXFP8)用什么方式控制低比特量化误差?","review_state":null,"rubric":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"mechanism","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"OCP Microscaling (MX) Formats Specification","url":"https://www.opencompute.org/documents/ocp-microscaling-formats-mx-v1-0-spec-final-pdf"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA Blackwell Tuning Guide","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/blackwell-tuning-guide/index.html"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"computer-architecture","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
